  "reasoning": "The defendant sold a health product (A9生精片) that was found to contain the prescription drug sildenafil (西地那非). This constitutes an illegal drug product that is not approved for sale and is misrepresented as a health supplement. Under Chinese criminal law, such conduct falls under the offense of producing and selling counterfeit or adulterated medicines (假药). No other listed charges apply to the facts.",
  "final_answer": "[罪名]生产、销售假药<eoa>"
